      "message": "Yes, I mean get the real solution upstream properly.  Don\u0027t give up on that, as if you have a hook here, you now need to rely on that for the next 20+ years, and that is never a good thing.\n\nIf upstream rejects the solution, then perhaps this is also not ok to take the hook as something is wrong with it.",
